From cc60359bcfec7edca624a08dbc3981b25d40094e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wray-lee <wray-lee@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:20:43 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] feat(config): add agent.reasoning_mode default

The reasoning display mode always started at `off` and `/restart` and
`/debug reset` hard-coded it back to `off`, so users on evicted idle
sessions had to re-run `/reasoning on` constantly.

Add `agent.reasoning_mode` (`off|on|stream`, default `off`) to
AgentConfig, parse and serialize it with the rest of the agent section,
and apply it to both `reasoning_mode` and the new
`default_reasoning_mode` when an Agent is created. Runtime resets now
restore that configured default; `/reasoning <mode>` still overrides the
mode for the current session only.

Docs updated in docs/en/configuration.md and docs/zh/configuration.md.
